title "Location and Environment"
layout tiers
subtitle "Platform Host/App Example for Insurance software - multiple locations and environments"

BC manage-claims: Manage Claims
BA claims-center: GuideWire Claims Center
BA policy-center: GuideWire Policy Center
BA billing-center: GuideWire Billing Center
BA suite-host: Guidewire Insurance Suite (Host)

SI suite-si: GuideWire Insurance Suite
SI cc-dev-uk: GuideWire Claims Center DEV UK
SI cc-dev-ny: GuideWire Claims Center DEV NY
SI cc-emea: GuideWire Claims Center EMEA
SI cc-ny-prod: GuideWire Claims Center NY PROD

TMSO dev-global: Guidewire Development Global
TMSO support-emea: Guidewire Support EMEA
TMSO support-us: Guidewire Support US
TMS app-mgmt: Application Mgmt Services

BSO cp-emea: Claims Processing EMEA
BSO cp-us: Claims Processing US
BS claims-processing: Claims Processing Services

# not modelled: "Environment Based Services" inset (Technology Service -> Prod/Non Prod/DR),
#   "Location Based Service" inset (Service -> Location 1/2/3), note on Service Portfolio references; legends

manage-claims -> claims-center
# slide draws three dashed References lines, all starting at Claims Center: to Suite (Host), Billing Center
# and Policy Center. Transcribed as drawn; CSDM would more naturally have each app reference the host.
claims-center -> suite-host
claims-center -> billing-center
claims-center -> policy-center

claims-center -> cc-emea
claims-center -> cc-ny-prod

# light-blue "Depends" lines: one curve from each Claims Center SI to the Insurance Suite SI
cc-dev-uk -> suite-si
cc-dev-ny -> suite-si
cc-emea -> suite-si
cc-ny-prod -> suite-si

# orange Contains lines (checked in deck XML): Development Global has four elbow connectors bound to all four
# Claims Center SIs. Support EMEA -> EMEA and Support US -> NY PROD. In the image they merge into one bus.
dev-global -> cc-dev-uk
dev-global -> cc-dev-ny
dev-global -> cc-emea
dev-global -> cc-ny-prod
support-emea -> cc-emea
support-us -> cc-ny-prod
dev-global -> app-mgmt
support-emea -> app-mgmt
support-us -> app-mgmt

# green Depends lines merge into one bus in the image; deck XML geometry confirms EMEA BSO -> EMEA SI, US BSO -> NY PROD SI
cp-emea -> cc-emea
cp-us -> cc-ny-prod
cp-emea -> claims-processing
cp-us -> claims-processing
